# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Model artifacts — large binaries NOT committed to git.
# The adapter config and tokenizer files ARE committed (small, text-based).
# Large binary weight files are excluded.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Model weight files (can be large)
*.safetensors
*.bin
*.pt
*.pth

# Optimizer states (checkpoint internals — large)
phi2-qlora-output/checkpoint-*/optimizer.pt
phi2-qlora-output/checkpoint-*/rng_state.pth
experiments/*/checkpoint-*/optimizer.pt
experiments/*/checkpoint-*/rng_state.pth

# TensorBoard event files
runs/
**/runs/
events.out.tfevents.*

# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# What IS committed:
#   - All Python scripts (train.py, run_experiments.py, eval_model.py, etc.)
#   - README files
#   - adapter_config.json, experiment_config.json, trainer_state.json
#   - Tokenizer config files (tokenizer_config.json, added_tokens.json, etc.)
#   - Tokenizer data files (vocab.json, merges.txt, tokenizer.json, special_tokens_map.json)
#   - plots/ directory (PNG figures)
#   - training_args.bin is excluded (binary, large)
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Training args binary
training_args.bin

# Eval reports (generated on the fly)
eval_report.json
eval_report.md

# Scratch / temp
*.log
*.tmp
scratch/
